SUMMARY:The Legend of Zelda 40th Anniversary Direct
DESCRIPTION:Nintendo will host a The Legend of Zelda 40th Anniversary Direct on September 8 at 7:00 a.m. PT / 10:00 a.m. ET. You will be able to watch it on YouTube (America\, Europe\, Japan) and Nintendo.com (America\, Europe\, Japan). \nThe presentation will last approximately 30 minutes.
