SUMMARY:Nintendo Direct: September 9\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:Nintendo will host a Nintendo Direct broadcast on September 9 at 7:00 a.m PT / 10:00 a.m. ET. You will be able to watch it on YouTube (America\, Europe\, Japan) and Nintendo.com (America\, Europe\, Japan). \nThe presentation will last approximately 45 minutes. A Nintendo Treehouse: Live stream will immediately follow the broadcast\, featuring gameplay of select titles featured during the Nintendo Direct.
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/nintendo-direct-september-9-2026
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Event_Nintendo-Direct_09-09-26.jpg
