SUMMARY:LEVEL-5 Vision 2026 II
DESCRIPTION:LEVEL-5 will host LEVEL-5 Vision 2026 II on September 10 at 6:00 a.m. PT / 8:00 a.m. ET / 21:00 JST. You will be able to watch it on YouTube (English / Traditional Chinese\, Japanese). \nThe broadcast will feature the latest news and updates on titles from LEVEL-5. English and Traditional Chinese subtitles will be available.
