SUMMARY:PC Gaming Show Tokyo Direct 2026
DESCRIPTION:PC Gamer will host PC Gaming Show Tokyo Direct 2026 as part of Tokyo Game Show 2026 on September 20 at 9:00 a.m. PT / 12:00 p.m. ET. You will be able to watch it on YouTube\, Twitch\, Twitter\, Facebook\, and Steam. \nThe 90-minute show will spotlight more than 35 games with publishers such as Atari\, Devolver Digital\, and New Blood Interactive confirmed to appear. Viewers can expect exclusive trailers\, news from the show floor\, developer interviews\, and world premieres.
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/pc-gaming-show-tokyo-direct-2026
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Event_PC-Gaming-Show-Tokyo_09-20-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
